{"lines":[{"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","y":0.046430827368852734,"w":0.30842910766601561,"c":1,"x":0.59578544606809691,"h":0.017522661277785456},{"c":1,"t":"with a range of cohesive devices [Based on | For example | However | Hence |","x":0.13404720928753658,"y":0.093467430152929687,"h":0.019927037492705191,"w":0.72232518513997412},{"y":0.11337209317107655,"w":0.69923370361328119,"t":"Besides that | Regarding that matter | This solution | This means that | In my","h":0.017441859820637617,"c":1,"x":0.13601533380638614},{"w":0.74712641398111979,"t":"honest opinion], with only occasional awkwardness or error [act in both situations","c":1,"y":0.13226744157682357,"x":0.13409962815440035,"h":0.01744828793494968},{"w":0.68794804890950523,"h":0.020753717091139157,"c":1,"y":0.14934835976182281,"x":0.13400823856424457,"t":"according to situations | In a conclusion]. Each paragraph contains a clear,"},{"y":0.16993051158618289,"t":"central topic. The range of vocabulary includes some less common items [fate |","h":0.016116000095350524,"c":1,"x":0.13409962027311356,"w":0.72988505045572927},{"c":1,"w":0.74137929280598958,"h":0.017513479376170538,"t":"paranoid] and shows examples of style and collocation [go with the flow | figured","x":0.13409962553394053,"y":0.18888186973855525},{"w":0.72413792928059895,"h":0.016108654453569238,"x":0.13409961761097416,"c":1,"y":0.20783322833930029,"t":"out a solution | problems are solved | my honest opinion]. Occasional errors do"},{"x":0.13409961960542735,"y":0.22520530627435065,"w":0.73371648152669267,"h":0.017527251324921722,"c":1,"t":"not prevent the message from coming through. There is a range of grammatical"},{"t":"structures and these are usually accurate, although there are a few errors [some","w":0.74137929280598958,"h":0.017471241785315672,"y":0.2441566646947706,"c":1,"x":0.13409962740926573},{"x":0.13409961530753794,"h":0.016135282028497122,"t":"people chooses | might not know what are the consequences | Not all bad","y":0.26308139529038044,"w":0.68199234008789067,"c":1},{"t":"situations needs to be ignored]. The meaning is still clear, however.","w":0.62090896606445312,"y":0.27906999383281095,"x":0.13399998927555412,"c":1,"h":0.020820862269446683},{"h":0.10914228177868868,"x":0.28228724984124748,"c":0.30000001192092896,"y":0.44749552411244997,"t":"7 2S : FIELTS","w":0.44109151204427083},{"c":1,"y":0.9534883721157994,"t":"129","x":0.86973180054172328,"h":0.014534883384680453,"w":0.034482758839925021}],"w":2400,"h":3166}